keywords:
  - neuromorphic photonics
  - diffractive neural network
  - slow light
  - Kerr nonlinearity
  - optical ROM
  - bound state in the continuum
  - GaN
abstract: >
  Concept paper: processing is optical (diffractive ROM). A light cache in
  a slower medium holds only a short echo. SiliconCache and context memory
  sit off-crystal. Large bricks use C-band silica, SOA/EDFA, and 3R
  regeneration on SiliconCache. Fibre dB/km is not ROM loss. The model is
  trained before writing. Implementation unrestricted; originator
  attribution (Anisul Wałsymzerp) must be kept.
version: 0.1.3
